 cleaning ability and reduced in foaming. The composition comprises as the active ingredients: an N-(long chain acyl)amino acid and/or salt thereof or an N-(linear alkyl)amino acid and/or salt thereof; and an alkylalkylene oxide and/or acylalkylene oxide.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un liquide de coupe qui présente de remarquables caractéristiques en termes de solubilité, pouvoir lubrifiant, aptitude à la coupe, propriétés antirouille, sécurité, action nettoyante et moussage réduit. Cette composition renferme les éléments actifs suivants: N-acyl aminoacide à chaîne longue et/ou sel de cet acide ou N-alkyl aminoacide linéaire et/ou sel de cet acide ; et oxyde d'alkylalkylène et/ou oxyde d'acylalkylène.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>